<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices mostly unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices mostly unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) and ammonia were mostly unchanged from Friday. Although trading was light, dealers expect demand to increase in the Midwest ahead of spring planting, dealers said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-175			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  187		 unc - dn 2.00</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		195			unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
